.avif?t=1769688900 width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/2384acd8b24e5b00050fc5b450987231.poster.avif?t=1769688900\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/2384acd8b24e5b00050fc5b450987231.webm?t=1769688900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/2384acd8b24e5b00050fc5b450987231.mp4?t=1769688900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten years after <i>The To-Do List</i>, <strong>Marla Myers</strong>, director of an art gallery, finds herself trapped in a crimson velvet purgatory, haunted by her past mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She must explore the limbo of her own mind across two parallel worlds. Find the clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rouge Carmin</i> is a narrative psychological horror game with a bold painterly aesthetic.  <br>No weapons. No escape. Only your memories, your guilt\u2026 and a way out to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/389585d659fd162d88fe11b4557fa0ed.poster.avif?t=1769688900\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/389585d659fd162d88fe11b4557fa0ed.webm?t=1769688900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/389585d659fd162d88fe11b4557fa0ed.mp4?t=1769688900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow an intense, twist-filled narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and collect key clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive against the monster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting, painterly atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/a10f61b7351ed701dbfc3071e0a680b0.poster.avif?t=1769688900\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/a10f61b7351ed701dbfc3071e0a680b0.webm?t=1769688900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/a10f61b7351ed701dbfc3071e0a680b0.mp4?t=1769688900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/2f6e18f2dfa0b245073201037f233cbc.avif?t=1769688900\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras_big/2f6e18f2dfa0b245073201037f233cbc.avif?t=1769688900 width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras/3f9fa84540fc355e80411a2bb71f79f8.avif?t=1769688900\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708640/extras_big/3f9fa84540fc355e80411a2bb71f79f8.avif?t=1769688900 width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 